1
00:00:03,214 --> 00:00:05,042
Open Tools, Audit Trail.

2
00:00:05,042 --> 00:00:08,150
Each row is one event, with the newest first.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:12,843
Its badges give the event name, the category, how long ago it happened,

4
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:14,854
and the user who caused it.

5
00:00:15,335 --> 00:00:19,060
The text next to the badges names the version and the item.

6
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:22,784
The version links to the item as it was then, and the title

7
00:00:22,784 --> 00:00:24,675
links to the item's editor.

8
00:00:25,151 --> 00:00:28,504
At the end of each row, View opens the item as it was

9
00:00:28,504 --> 00:00:31,688
at that version, and Details opens the full event.

10
00:00:31,688 --> 00:00:36,576
Published events whose version is no longer the latest, and Removed events, also

11
00:00:36,576 --> 00:00:38,111
get a Restore button.

12
00:00:38,579 --> 00:00:42,286
To narrow the list, use the Date and Category lists.

13
00:00:42,286 --> 00:00:45,481
The Sort list changes the order of the rows.

14
00:00:45,481 --> 00:00:49,379
Date offers ranges such as Last 24 hours and This week.

15
00:00:49,844 --> 00:00:54,053
Type a user name in the Search box to see one person's events.

16
00:00:54,053 --> 00:00:58,077
Searching for jamie keeps only the events that user caused.

17
00:00:58,077 --> 00:01:03,834
The Filters button opens a menu with Filter syntax, which lists the other search terms.

